{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Basil","id":"339235123759153162","is_bot":0,"username":"divinedefault"},"author_id":"339235123759153162","channel_id":"636017039126954024","content":"Navar is on watch","created_at":"2020-07-20T04:04:42.912000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"734621788167733279","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Basil","id":"339235123759153162","is_bot":0,"username":"divinedefault"},"author_id":"339235123759153162","channel_id":"636017039126954024","content":"\"Aarakockra, I saw you at the museum earlier. Are you in need of something?\"","created_at":"2020-07-20T04:05:33.317000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"734621999581757511","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Devloot","id":"246711433730064384","is_bot":0,"username":"devon8642"},"author_id":"246711433730064384","channel_id":"636017039126954024","content":"\"The masses feel orderly yet disorderly at the same time. What is this place?\"","created_at":"2020-07-20T04:06:25.656000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"734622219107303565","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Basil","id":"339235123759153162","is_bot":0,"username":"divinedefault"},"author_id":"339235123759153162","channel_id":"636017039126954024","content":"\"The chauteau is the base for an order of knights who hold to the virtues of the gods we have lost. We search for ways to aid the people and rebuild divinity\"","created_at":"2020-07-20T04:08:28.999000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"734622736445472871","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Devloot","id":"246711433730064384","is_bot":0,"username":"devon8642"},"author_id":"246711433730064384","channel_id":"636017039126954024","content":"\"This is... interesting. I myself am on a journey to the New World in pursuit of the True Philosopher stone, or as you might know it the Capstone of Arcania. Are any of your knights interested in alchemy, or would like to work with me to discover it's location on the island?\"","created_at":"2020-07-20T04:11:19.238000Z","edited_at":"2020-07-20T04:12:59.859000Z","id":"734623450479722507","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Devloot","id":"246711433730064384","is_bot":0,"username":"devon8642"},"author_id":"246711433730064384","channel_id":"636017039126954024","content":"\"Some might claim it divinity lost...\"","created_at":"2020-07-20T04:11:35.239000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"734623517592780820","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Basil","id":"339235123759153162","is_bot":0,"username":"divinedefault"},"author_id":"339235123759153162","channel_id":"636017039126954024","content":"\"I would not know. Florian would know more than I but he is resting. But once in the new world it could potentially be worth helping with. What is this stone said to be capable of?\"","created_at":"2020-07-20T04:14:20.976000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"734624212744142890","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Devloot","id":"246711433730064384","is_bot":0,"username":"devon8642"},"author_id":"246711433730064384","channel_id":"636017039126954024","content":"\"Rumor has it that the stone can cure all ills, transmute materials into gold and silver, and create jewels from naught but coal. If it were to be recovered, it could save millions of lives.\"","created_at":"2020-07-20T04:15:51.201000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"734624591175090186","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Devloot","id":"246711433730064384","is_bot":0,"username":"devon8642"},"author_id":"246711433730064384","channel_id":"636017039126954024","content":"\"And in the meantime on the journey, I would need help making medicinal remedies for the settlers and maintaining their health. Truly, a noble goal. Should you or any of your companions find my offer favorable, please find me such that I know who to hire for this endeavor.\"","created_at":"2020-07-20T04:17:42.117000Z","edited_at":"2020-07-20T04:17:45.270000Z","id":"734625056390643794","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Basil","id":"339235123759153162","is_bot":0,"username":"divinedefault"},"author_id":"339235123759153162","channel_id":"636017039126954024","content":"Navar tilts in consideration \"while I am a sworn initiate of the knighthood, i am first sworn as an afflicted.\" He raises his cilice. \"This sounds like it is worth the research.\"","created_at":"2020-07-20T04:19:56.253000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"734625618997542922","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Devloot","id":"246711433730064384","is_bot":0,"username":"devon8642"},"author_id":"246711433730064384","channel_id":"636017039126954024","content":"Rah nods \"I bring order from chaos, as do you and your peers. I require four assistants- compatriots, for this project. Contact me posthaste such that I can draft the papers for our agreement\"","created_at":"2020-07-20T04:22:01.176000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"734626142962581534","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Basil","id":"339235123759153162","is_bot":0,"username":"divinedefault"},"author_id":"339235123759153162","channel_id":"636017039126954024","content":"\"I am currently on watch. Where could I find you tomorrow evening?\"","created_at":"2020-07-20T04:22:49.558000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"734626345891659786","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
