{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"schrödingers dumbass","id":"264570136025890816","is_bot":0,"username":"greylikessharks"},"author_id":"264570136025890816","channel_id":"636017039126954024","content":"“I’m looking for information, really, regarding an initiation I might be thinking about participating in.” They stand straight, trying to make up for the difference in height.","created_at":"2020-07-20T05:07:42.762000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"734637642007707678","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Basil","id":"339235123759153162","is_bot":0,"username":"divinedefault"},"author_id":"339235123759153162","channel_id":"636017039126954024","content":"\"With the knights du roi soleil? It's a matter of faith and good will. We stand to uphold the virtues of gods lost in the day of the black sun. We preserve divinity and seek to have it restored in our world. If you feel worthy, you should speak with florian in the morning.\"","created_at":"2020-07-20T05:11:23.534000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"734638567992721508","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"schrödingers dumbass","id":"264570136025890816","is_bot":0,"username":"greylikessharks"},"author_id":"264570136025890816","channel_id":"636017039126954024","content":"“What kind of faith?”","created_at":"2020-07-20T05:12:06.310000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"734638747408400445","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Basil","id":"339235123759153162","is_bot":0,"username":"divinedefault"},"author_id":"339235123759153162","channel_id":"636017039126954024","content":"\"Faith that the world can be restored. Many follow those who were corrupted or destroyed.\" he says, the symbol of chauntea showing branded on his chest","created_at":"2020-07-20T05:14:08.781000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"734639261088743456","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"schrödingers dumbass","id":"264570136025890816","is_bot":0,"username":"greylikessharks"},"author_id":"264570136025890816","channel_id":"636017039126954024","content":"They nod. “And do you protect those who need protection, or are you glorified sellswords?”","created_at":"2020-07-20T05:15:57.681000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"734639717848711299","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Basil","id":"339235123759153162","is_bot":0,"username":"divinedefault"},"author_id":"339235123759153162","channel_id":"636017039126954024","content":"\"We uphold virtue and help those who have need. Our skills are put where we feel our oath leads us, I myself have an eye to the new world.\"","created_at":"2020-07-20T05:18:21.800000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"734640322327347211","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"schrödingers dumbass","id":"264570136025890816","is_bot":0,"username":"greylikessharks"},"author_id":"264570136025890816","channel_id":"636017039126954024","content":"“As do I.” They fall silent for a moment. “If this society truly does protect the vulnerable, I will be back in morning to speak with the one called Florian.”","created_at":"2020-07-20T05:20:27.633000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"734640850109464688","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
